      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a challenging dynamic to navigate when you feel like the cause is at a cellular level, as if your body is predisposed to it. In that sense, therapy and self-care may not be enough to overcome the underlying biological factors. Sometimes, feeling like you're fighting a predetermined outcome can be debilitating and lead to feelings of hopelessness. Acknowledge that this doesn't mean you should give up, but rather, it may be essential to reframe your expectations and focus on what you can control in the present moment.",
      "source": "target",
